      "title": "QUIC: Fix a use of a negative offset with tvb_bytes_exist",
      "message": "QUIC: Fix a use of a negative offset with tvb_bytes_exist\n\nThis doesn't do what it's intended to do. Fix it so that as intended,\nit checks that the buffer has at least 16 bytes as a trailer and that\nall of them exist.\n",
